<article>
  <div class="article-header">
    <h1>Lakewood Cannabis — Standish and Madison Maine</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Two-store Maine medical cannabis operator with the Inhale Zen heritage-strain product line</p>
  </div>
  <p class="image-source" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-light);font-style:italic;margin-top:-1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Image: AI-generated illustration of a Maine small-town dispensary, generated for this guide. Not a photograph of the actual storefront.</p>

  <section class="fact-box">
    <h2>Lakewood Cannabis at a Glance</h2>
    <table aria-label="Lakewood Cannabis dispensary overview">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Fact</th><th scope="col">Details</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Operator</strong></td><td>Lakewood Cannabis</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Locations</strong></td><td>Standish, ME and Madison, ME</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>License Type</strong></td><td>Medical cannabis dispensary (per operator's site)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>House Brand</strong></td><td>Inhale Zen (heritage / heirloom / old-school strains)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Service Area</strong></td><td>Central and southern Maine</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Primary Sources</strong></td><td>lakewood-cannabis.com · Weedmaps</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>Lakewood Cannabis operates two Maine medical cannabis storefronts — one in Standish, one in Madison — and is the home of the Inhale Zen product line. The Inhale Zen brand specializes in "old school," heirloom, and heritage cannabis strains, positioning the operator in the craft / nostalgia segment of the Maine medical market.</p>
    <p>The operator markets itself as "knowledge, consistency, and service," emphasizing the heritage-strain focus as a differentiator from operators that chase the newest genetics. The two-store footprint covers central Maine (Madison / Somerset County) and southern Maine (Standish / Cumberland County), with each location carrying a distinct menu tailored to the local market.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Locations</h2>
    <p><strong>Standish:</strong> Standish is a Cumberland County town on Route 25 between Windham and Gorham. The Lakewood Cannabis Standish location serves the greater Portland / Windham / Sebago Lakes region.</p>
    <p><strong>Madison:</strong> Madison is in Somerset County along the Kennebec River. The Lakewood Cannabis Madison location serves the central Maine corridor including Skowhegan, Waterville, and the surrounding Somerset County communities.</p>
    <p>Both locations carry the Inhale Zen house brand, but each has distinct menu options per the operator's site. Confirm addresses and hours with the operator before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The Inhale Zen Product Line</h2>
    <p>Inhale Zen is Lakewood Cannabis's in-house brand, focused on heritage / heirloom / "old school" cannabis strains. The brand markets itself around:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Heirloom genetics</strong> — older, time-tested cultivars rather than the latest cross-breeds</li>
      <li><strong>Craft cultivation</strong> — small-batch, hands-on growing</li>
      <li><strong>Consistency</strong> — same strain profile batch over batch, the way landrace and heirloom genetics are supposed to express</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For medical patients who specifically prefer classic cultivars over modern hybrids, the Inhale Zen line offers a curated selection that distinguishes Lakewood Cannabis from operators that lean into the latest designer genetics.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to Verify Before You Go</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Official site:</strong> <a href="https://lakewood-cannabis.com/">lakewood-cannabis.com</a></li>
      <li><strong>Standish store page:</strong> <a href="https://lakewood-cannabis.com/standish-store/">lakewood-cannabis.com/standish-store</a></li>
      <li><strong>Weedmaps:</strong> <a href="https://weedmaps.com/dispensaries/lakewood-cannabis-2">weedmaps.com/dispensaries/lakewood-cannabis-2</a></li>
      <li><strong>Standish guide:</strong> <a href="/guides/standish-dispensary-guide">Town-level overview of Standish dispensaries</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Bring your Maine MMMP card and a valid government photo ID.</p>
  </section>

